// Mass FSLogix profile failures: alert on the rate, not the event            chain step 5
// Template from Part III. A handful of failures is a normal Monday; a spike across many
// users means a broken storage path or something encrypting the containers.
// Needs: the FSLogix Operational event log (Microsoft-FSLogix-Apps/Operational) collected
//        through a data collection rule. Tune the threshold to your estate.
Event
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h)
| where Source startswith "Microsoft-FSLogix-Apps" and EventLevelName == "Error"
| summarize Errors = count(), Hosts = dcount(Computer) by bin(TimeGenerated, 5m)
| where Errors >= 10
| order by TimeGenerated desc
